## Schema-as-Code

### HCL Schema (Recommended)

Use database-specific file extensions for editor support: `.pg.hcl` (PostgreSQL), `.my.hcl` (MySQL), `.lt.hcl` (SQLite).

```hcl
schema "public" {
  comment = "Application schema"
}

table "users" {
  schema = schema.public
  column "id" {
    type = bigint
  }
  column "email" {
    type = varchar(255)
    null = false
  }
  column "created_at" {
